  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Established in 1878, Ashland University is a private university in Ashland, Ohio. With its strong foundation in liberal arts, the University provides a broad range of academic programs across multiple fields of study.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Ashland University offers a vibrant and diverse student life. With over 100 student clubs, you can explore various cultural activities at the University.</p><p>The Counseling Services in the Student Centre provide you with personal and professional support. The University promotes physical health through the AU Rec Centre and the Student Health Centre for medical needs.</p><p>The University also hosts regular cultural and community events, leadership seminars, and spiritual retreats, promoting personal growth.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Ashland University offers various on-campus housing options. You can choose from residence halls, on-campus houses, or apartment-style accommodations. All stay options are equipped with modern amenities and recreational spaces and are located near the campus buildings.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The Archer Library at Ashland University offers a wide range of resources. &nbsp;The library boasts over 650,000 digital and print resources, including books and e-books. The main floor features a Lyceum Cafe, an XR conference room, and a student IT help desk for tech support.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>Ashland University offers a robust athletics program, with numerous varsity and intramural sports. The university's athletics teams compete at the NCAA Division II level, and you can participate in a variety of sports including basketball, football, soccer, volleyball, and track and field. The university boasts state-of-the-art athletic facilities, including a sports complex, fitness centre, and outdoor fields.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>Ashland University has cutting-edge labs in biology, chemistry, engineering, and computer science, giving you hands-on experience in your studies.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>The University provides diverse dining options with meal plans for different dietary needs. The main dining hall, the Eagle’s Nest, serves a variety of meals. You can also have quick bites at cafes and snack shops across the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
